{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03547",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.9,
      "end_seconds": 3.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Afternoon, thanks for coming in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.91,
      "end_seconds": 8.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Hi doctor, I got here as fast as I could."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.65,
      "end_seconds": 11.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "what's been worrying you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.79,
      "end_seconds": 15.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "I'm here because of blurred vision on standing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.65,
      "end_seconds": 20.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.86,
      "end_seconds": 23.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "no, I'm not on anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.16,
      "end_seconds": 34.97,
      "duration_seconds": 10.81,
      "text": "So, tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.75,
      "end_seconds": 45.53,
      "duration_seconds": 8.78,
      "text": "Oh, I notice it more with standing. Maybe a six out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.04,
      "end_seconds": 49.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.01,
      "end_seconds": 68.72,
      "duration_seconds": 18.71,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get blacking out when I stand quickly as well. About blacking out when I stand quickly, it's a few times a day. Only lying down, and it's not much."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.65,
      "end_seconds": 71.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Have you been feeling lightheaded?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.84,
      "end_seconds": 75.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Yes, since last Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.9,
      "end_seconds": 82.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "And what about head injury, chest pain, seizure or palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.98,
      "end_seconds": 86.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "no, not a single one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.86,
      "end_seconds": 91.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Okay, on the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.75,
      "end_seconds": 94.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.72,
      "end_seconds": 99.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 103.22,
      "end_seconds": 105.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "mm, my brother has epilepsy"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 106.72,
      "end_seconds": 110.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.73,
      "end_seconds": 124.49,
      "duration_seconds": 13.76,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. I only drink at family occasions. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.31,
      "end_seconds": 128.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "What operations have you had, if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 129.61,
      "end_seconds": 134.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "Yes, I had an operation for a hernia, last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.39,
      "end_seconds": 140.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.29,
      "end_seconds": 152.21,
      "duration_seconds": 10.92,
      "text": "I have high blood pressure, for about ten years. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.06,
      "end_seconds": 163.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.12,
      "end_seconds": 167.75,
      "duration_seconds": 2.63,
      "text": "not to my knowledge, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.01,
      "end_seconds": 190.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.6,
      "end_seconds": 205.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.56,
      "end_seconds": 226.25,
      "duration_seconds": 8.69,
      "text": "okay: BP is 99 over 64, height 182 centimetres, heart rate 104, temperature is 37.0 degrees, weight 61 kilos"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.94,
      "end_seconds": 228.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.4,
      "end_seconds": 233.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.7,
      "end_seconds": 240.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.72,
      "end_seconds": 256.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "sure thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.86,
      "end_seconds": 259.34,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.29,
      "end_seconds": 280.19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.9,
      "text": "Your blood pressure drops a long way when you stand and your heart sounds are normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.02,
      "end_seconds": 282.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.77,
      "end_seconds": 297.67,
      "duration_seconds": 11.9,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Putting it all together, I'd lean towards medicine-induced postural hypotension. An arrhythmia is still possible. I want blood tests done, that's for syncope."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 298.7,
      "end_seconds": 302.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "I can book that for Tuesday at 2 pm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.41,
      "end_seconds": 314.39,
      "duration_seconds": 10.98,
      "text": "I'm going to order an ECG, for syncope. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.0,
      "end_seconds": 317.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Does it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.6,
      "end_seconds": 336.22,
      "duration_seconds": 17.62,
      "text": "we will move the prostate tablet to bedtime and you should rise slowly if you smoke, this is a good moment to think about stopping, and we can help you with that come back in two weeks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.81,
      "end_seconds": 340.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "alright, I'll be back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 340.73,
      "end_seconds": 343.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 345.13,
      "end_seconds": 347.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "I think I understand everything thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.02,
      "end_seconds": 350.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}